omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7TkGvTn_W3sQ7kNvwH7m8Ri&_nc_oc=Adol64e4W2yCLuyc9_Erxi1BHta19lVsROvYSiKZYzx8S07KyoNEj2GMy7N60LAujZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLHDXBzQ4M0akmS3Fsu6SFCLoFKZSfR944JUPTh6RqkGA&oe=6ABE7AB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LmE853SgAcAQ7kNvwH6JMBD&_nc_oc=AdpY7DSdJUu2Izq7Y7VPOeWTEvvQOGpegmOfz_8-SEbVK-zX0G7aalSEY9E457cKqOc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIuQxc9Mt2ycrGnib925zOfzI_0f0jN78pofhzN15c9HQ&oe=6ABE7C16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x6RVqCoEXEYQ7kNvwHKeU4D&_nc_oc=AdoS0jVvDydceBfzKFk8_apGNBmdEjzVRPiBCs50-TG9GXUhS1oRv3y65mbUGiuWUm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJUNbXhDWtCRzMo_PgROXCYK0Z1hBuLzwufnDC1joliEw&oe=6ABE58F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://